{"title":"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Participation in the local soccer league this year is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> higher than last year. The number of males increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fbf33b81900fa9e836a608be7484b4c4d6ea3ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" /> and the number of females increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />. What fraction of the soccer league is now female?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/a/1dad97426616f5c288425b1b36a8e47a27baee35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }\\frac{1}{3} \\qquad \\text{(B) }\\frac{4}{11} \\qquad \\text{(C) }\\frac{2}{5} \\qquad \\text{(D) }\\frac{4}{9} \\qquad \\text{(E) }\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"362\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the amount of soccer players last year be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, the number of male players last year to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, and the number of females players last year to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/e/45e36aab956539c8bfa63f17f6cdbfd85a5e2f4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"16\" /> We want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/4/bd44e71cecd1321c7748ac838c4d6f3bcf508c73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1.2f}{1.1x},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"45\" height=\"39\" /> since that's the fraction of female players now. From the problem, we are given \n</p><p>\\begin{align*}\nx&amp;=m+f \\\\\n1.1x&amp;=1.05m+1.2f \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>Eliminating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/3/523fc9584bb7058e4986d06e34b12c7e0ae684da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1.2f}{1.1x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"40\" height=\"39\" /> gives us our answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/7/62784085b64d42860a84043fa7ea53d36106e9bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } \\frac {4}{11}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"75\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>Also, you know the number has to be divisible by 11, and there’s only one answer that fits!:)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P\">2002 AMC 10P</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 6\">6</a